  "description": "Both legs of the L run floor to ceiling, 900 inside along the back wall (900 deep) and 300 along the left wall, one space round the corner. Doors 2437 high, 25 thick: two of 433 wide on the back-wall leg, 294 wide on the left-wall leg (it covers the corner). No bench: the pine cupboard stands there instead. Inside, within its 25 boards (rear panels against the walls included): 1350 × 850 along the back wall and 450 × 300 along the left wall, 2393 high. The bedroom's pine cupboard (1000 wide, 400 deep, 2000 high) in place of the bench, moved: the middle of its back at x 500, y 300, facing the left wall. The kitchen island against the front wall between the sink and the desk, its long side out (x 800-1570), coming 1260 out from the wall to y 4119. The Ivar, lying on its side (830 long, 300 wide, 800 high), against the first radiator, 830 out into the room.From plan3/room_3d.html",
